<title>UK: UAL names senior vice president-fleet ops.</title>
<headline>UAL names senior vice president-fleet ops.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Airlines said it appointed Andrew Studdert as senior vice president - fleet operations and administration, effective September 1.</p>
<p>Succeeding Joseph O'Gorman, Studdert will be responsible for all aspects of fleet operations, including engine and airframe maintenance, engineering and security. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
